{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the proposed accommodation would meet identified local need for a residential care home and no nomination arrangements have been agreed with the Council to prevent importation of need from outside of the Borough. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policy SC8.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal has failed to demonstrate how the proposed development will avoid any adverse impact on the amenity of neighbouring residents due to the increased comings and goings expected from occupants, visitors and staff, leading to greater noise, disturbances and parking and traffic stress within the neighbourhood. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2, EC2 and EQ5.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that the development would not have an unacceptable impact upon on-street parking conditions in the area and has also failed to set out sufficient space for safe pedestrian access to the site, cycle storage and waste and recycling provisions. Therefore, the proposal fails to demonstrate that it would not prejudice the safe and efficient operation of the Local Transport Network, this would be contrary to London Plan Policies T6 and T6.1 and Local Plan Policies EC2 and EQ5."
  ],
